<p id="_7b0b1cae-2243-a5cb-42b8-56fb0c581519" semx-id="_7b0b1cae-2243-a5cb-42b8-56fb0c581519">ID Identifier</p>

<p id="_0f9ca4e6-6b64-304e-7a7e-b768349f16e3" semx-id="_0f9ca4e6-6b64-304e-7a7e-b768349f16e3">IHO  International Hydrographic Organization</p>

<p id="_1b932ef5-e0bc-197b-f481-52012deb3a1d" semx-id="_1b932ef5-e0bc-197b-f481-52012deb3a1d">ISO International Organization for Standardization</p>

<p id="_95be0795-1b2f-de33-9e4a-4ca9204b7e09" semx-id="_95be0795-1b2f-de33-9e4a-4ca9204b7e09">LADM  Land Administration Domain Model</p>

